{"title":"Career Roadmap: AgriTech Field Officer","role":"AgriTech Field Officer","summary":"Career Domain: Agriculture, Food & Life Sciences · Qualification Pathway: B.Sc – Precision Agriculture / Agri-Tech · Target Career: AgriTech Field Officer","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Hons) Agriculture and Allied","Course":"Precision Agriculture / Agri-Tech"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An AgriTech Field Officer works with farmers on the ground for an agri-tech company - signing them up, advising on crops and inputs, and making sure the company's app or service works for them."},{"type":"h","text":"What a AgriTech Field Officer does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Visit farmers and onboard them to the platform"},{"text":"Give crop advice and solve field problems"},{"text":"Collect field data and photos"},{"text":"Support sales of inputs or crop buying"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Agri-tech start-ups"},{"text":"Agri-input companies"},{"text":"FPOs"},{"text":"Crop-buying platforms"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Field Officer"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Senior Field Officer"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Cluster Manager"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Regional Manager"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Head of Field Operations"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1: Agriculture basics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Agronomy, plant protection and soil science"},{"text":"Learn your area's